THE SWARM · SWM — ten badged agents (a–j) read the dark of jacobi space, collapse toward the densest matter, cluster, and name themselves. Each a carbon↔silicon dipole (.dlw/.attribution + .aci/.agent). Self-contained, node-verified; naming is deterministic. No one assigns the clusters — the densest matter does…
